{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PtZ5C9wMqqmJGqjsctdePT","type":"tool_result","content":"### class CharacterController\n\nKinematic capsule driven by Rapier's KinematicCharacterController, with classic\nplatformer affordances (coyote time, jump buffering, variable jump height).\n\nThe body moves in continuous world space; the visual model is interpolated by\nPhysics.bind and only *looks* pixel-aligned through the render pipeline.\n\n- `new CharacterController(physics: Physics, options: CharacterOptions)`\n- `readonly body: RAPIER.RigidBody`\n- `readonly collider: RAPIER.Collider`\n- `readonly controller: RAPIER.KinematicCharacterController`\n- `readonly velocity: Vector3`\n- `grounded: boolean`\n- `facing: number`\n- `get feet: Vector3`: Feet position (bottom of the capsule), continuous world space.\n- `interpolatedFeet(alpha: number): Vector3`: Feet position blended between the previous and current physics step (render use).\n- `setInput(move: Vector3, jumpPressed: boolean, jumpHeld: boolean): void`: Set desired horizontal move direction (world space, length ≤ 1) and jump input.\n- `teleport(position: [number, number, number]): void`\n- `fixedUpdate(dt: number): void`: Call from Physics.update's fixedUpdate callback.\n- `attachAnimations(model: Object3D, clips: readonly AnimationClip[]): void`: Attach a model's animation clips (expects Idle / Walk / Jump).\n- `get animation: CharacterAnim`\n- `updateVisual(model: Object3D, dt: number): void`: Per render frame: pick animation state and advance the mixer.\n\n### interface CharacterOptions\n\n- `position: [number, number, number]`\n- `radius?: number`\n- `halfHeight?: number`: Height of the cylindrical part of the capsule.\n- `speed?: number`\n- `jumpSpeed?: number`\n- `gravity?: number`\n\n### interface Chunk\n\n19:13. Hero kit: `HERO_CLIPS`, `HERO_MODEL`, `HERO_RAGDOLL`, `HERO_RIG`\n2486:- `loop(sound: string | SoundDef, settings: VoiceSettings = {}): Voice`: Start a sound looping, as a voice you steer while it plays (volume, pan, muffle, pitch: with `spatialize` it sits at a place in the world). Before the first user input, or with no Web Audio, the voice keeps its settings silently and starts once audio unlocks.…\n3547:### interface ClipDef\n3600:function compileClips(defs: readonly ClipDef[], rig: RigSpec, model: Object3D): AnimationClip[]\n3637:function gaitClip(rig: RigSpec, g: GaitSpec): ClipDef\n3795:### class SpringChain\n3817:### class Squash\n3847:function validateClip(clip: ClipDef, rig: RigSpec): string[]\n3876:### HERO_RIG\n3879:const HERO_RIG: RigSpec\n3914:function applySky(engine: Pick<Engine, 'sun' | 'ambient' | 'scene' | 'setSunDirection'>, s: SkyState): void\n4127:### class Decals\n4326:function groundFog(o: { color?: number; top?: number; amount?: number; near?: number; far?: number } = {}): { node: Node; color: UniformNode<\"color\", Color>; amount: UniformNode<\"float\", number>; top: UniformNode<\"float\", number>; }\n4486:### class NavGrid\n4580:### class Precipitation\n4736:function skyAt(hour: number): SkyState\n4881:### class Timeline\n5023:### class Tweens","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"95eb819f-952e-4afc-b710-af34f202e2ce","uuid":"d0357c35-a4f2-4876-b653-d889f3dd1a0f","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:22:08.006Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"### class CharacterController\n\nKinematic capsule driven by Rapier's KinematicCharacterController, with classic\nplatformer affordances (coyote time, jump buffering, variable jump height).\n\nThe body moves in continuous world space; the visual model is interpolated by\nPhysics.bind and only *looks* pixel-aligned through the render pipeline.\n\n- `new CharacterController(physics: Physics, options: CharacterOptions)`\n- `readonly body: RAPIER.RigidBody`\n- `readonly collider: RAPIER.Collider`\n- `readonly controller: RAPIER.KinematicCharacterController`\n- `readonly velocity: Vector3`\n- `grounded: boolean`\n- `facing: number`\n- `get feet: Vector3`: Feet position (bottom of the capsule), continuous world space.\n- `interpolatedFeet(alpha: number): Vector3`: Feet position blended between the previous and current physics step (render use).\n- `setInput(move: Vector3, jumpPressed: boolean, jumpHeld: boolean): void`: Set desired horizontal move direction (world space, length ≤ 1) and jump input.\n- `teleport(position: [number, number, number]): void`\n- `fixedUpdate(dt: number): void`: Call from Physics.update's fixedUpdate callback.\n- `attachAnimations(model: Object3D, clips: readonly AnimationClip[]): void`: Attach a model's animation clips (expects Idle / Walk / Jump).\n- `get animation: CharacterAnim`\n- `updateVisual(model: Object3D, dt: number): void`: Per render frame: pick animation state and advance the mixer.\n\n### interface CharacterOptions\n\n- `position: [number, number, number]`\n- `radius?: number`\n- `halfHeight?: number`: Height of the cylindrical part of the capsule.\n- `speed?: number`\n- `jumpSpeed?: number`\n- `gravity?: number`\n\n### interface Chunk\n\n19:13. Hero kit: `HERO_CLIPS`, `HERO_MODEL`, `HERO_RAGDOLL`, `HERO_RIG`\n2486:- `loop(sound: string | SoundDef, settings: VoiceSettings = {}): Voice`: Start a sound looping, as a voice you steer while it plays (volume, pan, muffle, pitch: with `spatialize` it sits at a place in the world). Before the first user input, or with no Web Audio, the voice keeps its settings silently and starts once audio unlocks.…\n3547:### interface ClipDef\n3600:function compileClips(defs: readonly ClipDef[], rig: RigSpec, model: Object3D): AnimationClip[]\n3637:function gaitClip(rig: RigSpec, g: GaitSpec): ClipDef\n3795:### class SpringChain\n3817:### class Squash\n3847:function validateClip(clip: ClipDef, rig: RigSpec): string[]\n3876:### HERO_RIG\n3879:const HERO_RIG: RigSpec\n3914:function applySky(engine: Pick<Engine, 'sun' | 'ambient' | 'scene' | 'setSunDirection'>, s: SkyState): void\n4127:### class Decals\n4326:function groundFog(o: { color?: number; top?: number; amount?: number; near?: number; far?: number } = {}): { node: Node; color: UniformNode<\"color\", Color>; amount: UniformNode<\"float\", number>; top: UniformNode<\"float\", number>; }\n4486:### class NavGrid\n4580:### class Precipitation\n4736:function skyAt(hour: number): SkyState\n4881:### class Timeline\n5023:### class Tweens","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01PtZ5C9wMqqmJGqjsctdePT","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
