tation\n4581-\n4582-- `new Precipitation(o: PrecipitationOptions)`\n4583-- `readonly kind: PrecipitationKind`\n4584-- `readonly area: readonly [number, number, number]`\n4585-- `readonly wind: Vector2`: Wind (m/s along x and z): rain slants, snow drifts.\n4586-- `get intensity: number`: Share of the drops falling (0..1).\n4587-- `get speed: number`: Fall speed (m/s).\n4588-- `update(dt: number, center: Vector3): void`: Per frame (game time): advance the fall and follow `center`.\n4589-- `splashes(dt: number): number`: How many drops hit the ground in `dt` seconds at this intensity (for splash particles, ripples).\n4590-- `dispose(): this`: Frees the GPU-related resources allocated by this instance\n4591-\n4592-### type PrecipitationKind\n4593-\n4594-```ts\nfunction groundFog(o: { color?: number; top?: number; amount?: number; near?: number; far?: number } = {}): { node: Node; color: UniformNode<\"color\", Color>; amount: UniformNode<\"float\", number>; top: UniformNode<\"float\", number>; }\n```\n\nFog for `scene.fogNode` with live settings (uniforms: changing them never recompiles):\nground mist that thickens below `top` (m) and a haze that grows with distance from the\ncamera, both up to `amount` (0..1), in `color` (match the sky).\n\n  const mist = groundFog({ color: s.sky, top: 1.5 });\n  (scene as { fogNode: unknown }).fogNode = mist.node;\n  mist.amount.value = 0.8; mist.color.value.setHex(s.sky);\n4734-\n4735-```ts\n4736:function skyAt(hour: number): SkyState\n4737-```\n4738-\n4739-The sky at `hour` (wraps around 24).\n4740-\n4741-### interface SkyState\n4742-\n4741:### interface SkyState\n4742-\n4743-- `readonly sunDir: [number, number, number]`: Unit vector toward the sun (or the moon, at night).\n4744-- `readonly sunColor: number`\n4745-- `readonly sunIntensity: number`\n4746-- `readonly ambientColor: number`\n4747-- `readonly ambientIntensity: number`\n4748-- `readonly sky: number`: Background (sky) and fog colour.\n4749-- `readonly night: number`: 0 by day, 1 deep at night: lanterns, stars, windows.\n4750-\n4751-### interface Snapshot\n4752-\n4753-- `readonly format: 1`\n4754-- `readonly engine: string`: The engine version that took it (a different one may not restore the same).\n4755-- `readonly game: string`: The game's name: a snapshot restores into the same game.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01SZ4KitDNsxAp2jS3RDwPv5","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
