{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkkS1yka1Yjeig5KYFJy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I closed most of the gaps the stop hook listed, but the Net Loft and the Dame's barrel and niche hiding are still not covered by the full plan's testing list. `node tools/test.mjs` now runs everything and prints `432 passed, 0 failed`; that run included the whole-game bot playthrough from Arrival to the credits. I have still never played the game by hand or listened to it. `PLAN.md`, `TASK.md`, the HTML build and `exit-interview.json` are all in the work folder.\n\n**What changed in this pass**\n- **Net Loft:** built a real upper floor with an inside ladder, plus outside ladders islanders raise every 25 s during the siege. Climb up and press Action to knock a ladder down and the climbers fall with it. Enemies can't melee you up there. A test covers climbing, the prompts and the knock-down.\n- **Pushable wardrobe:** now tested; it slides about a metre along one axis.\n- **Ragdolls and scarf:** scatter and explosion kills now ragdoll (at most 8 live), and Max's red scarf is a spring chain behind her neck.\n- **Kenney nature cliffs:** a ring of cliffs now stands behind the open areas, embedded in the single file and credited on the About screen. The file grew from 5.8 MB to 7.3 MB because of it.\n- **Real bugs found:**\n  - Player gravity had the wrong sign, so anything leaving the ground, including the loft ladder, flew upward.\n  - Ladder and Extra markers weren't being recognised on the map.\n  - The Nave playthrough could stall on the final boss; the bot plan is fixed.\n- **Browser and hub checks re-run against the final build:** the boot check passes (15 checks), as do the 2-player, 4-player lossy, host-leave and server hub scenarios. A new two-page check also passes: a party on one computer lists the host, fills the seat, starts, runs a countdown and plays with no errors.\n\n**Still not done**\n- Two-computer WebRTC invite codes are verified in Node only, with simulated links; no two-browser WebRTC run.\n- The optional animation list is only partly covered.\n- The Dame's barrel and niche hiding in the abbey is only lightly exercised.\n- The bot has god mode on and cheats the Dame's crypt.\n\nThe Source Information, Testing, Engine and Prompt Feedback from my last reply are unchanged, and the About screen and `exit-interview.json` still carry them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":456,"cache_read_input_tokens":742666,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":456},"output_tokens":730,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"95eb819f-952e-4afc-b710-af34f202e2ce","uuid":"d7e82c57-8554-424a-965f-be46d806b2eb","timestamp":"2026-11-06T00:45:05.245Z","request_id":"req_011CgkkS1htEvjcgUVxHmHZk"}
