{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkvXAiAmwr8sY1xQT86s","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I still don't have a no-cheat playthrough from Arrival to the credits, so that item from `PLAN.md` stays open. A bot with no cheats (no god mode, no one-hit kills, no teleporting) now plays through the quay, the road, the cannery, the yard and the causeway and reaches the abbey. It then stalls in the Dame's crypt. The Node suites pass (437), and the browser suites and all four hub scenarios pass against the rebuilt game.\n\nI never played the game by hand or listened to it; this machine can't do either.\n\n**Why the full run isn't there**\n- **The Dame's crypt:** the bot hides in a niche and waits, but the three knights patrol close by, so it never gets away from them.\n- **The Bosun:** on Assisted difficulty the bot died 21 times in the yard; on Standard, more. The plan allows at most 3 deaths per chapter. Assisted is a difficulty setting, not a cheat, so I used it for the no-cheat run.\n- **Not reached:** the nave boss and the launch have never been played without cheats.\n\n**What the no-cheat test asserts:** only that the bot reaches the abbey, and the test is marked as a known limit. After a death the bot is put back at full coverage, so deaths are counted but don't end the run.\n\n**What still uses cheats:** the full Arrival-to-credits run, with god mode and one-hit kills on, still passes. The quay is also played without cheats on Standard in a separate test.\n\n**Fixes made along the way:**\n- **Conveyor belts:** a conveyor belt used to cancel Max's own movement, so she could not walk against it. It now adds to her speed instead.\n- **Bot play:** it now shops at Mr. Fathom, switches guns, picks up loot, steps out of burning oil, and wiggles free of tight spots.\n- **Quay hay cart:** the hay cart in the quay trapped players against a prop, so it no longer blocks movement.\n- **Solid props:** large solid props are now marked as blocked for enemy and bot pathfinding.\n\nThe Source Information and the Testing, Engine and Prompt Feedback from earlier replies are unchanged."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":637,"cache_read_input_tokens":869946,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":637},"output_tokens":711,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"95eb819f-952e-4afc-b710-af34f202e2ce","uuid":"c907f720-65aa-4a7b-8939-2e26e1026c45","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:57:22.962Z","request_id":"req_011CgkvXAQ4dCpQfyuzv9Ubk"}
