{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkvpV4CsNn8vYe3CYhKK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The no-cheat playthrough is still not complete, and I'm stopping here rather than keep tuning the bot. That item from `PLAN.md` stays open. The game is built, the single HTML file and `exit-interview.json` are in the work folder, and the Node tests (391) and the boot check (15) pass.\n\nI never played the game by hand or listened to it; this machine can't do either.\n\n**What the no-cheat bot does now**\n- **Chapters it completes:** with no cheats, on Assisted difficulty, it plays the quay, the road, the cannery, the yard and the causeway into the abbey. It now also gets through the Dame's crypt without cheats. It does this by walking to the lever and whacking knights that get close, so I dropped the hiding behaviour that made it stall.\n- **Where it fails:** it dies about 20 times in the yard fight with the Bosun. A bot can't match the crane timing, and the four islanders added every 40 s overrun it and drain its ammo. It never reaches the nave boss or the launch without cheats.\n- **What the test checks:** the saved no-cheat test only asserts that the bot reaches the abbey, and it is marked as a known limit.\n- **The cheat run:** the full Arrival-to-credits run with god mode and one-hit kills still passes.\n\nI did not touch the Source Information or the Testing, Engine and Prompt Feedback from earlier replies.\n\nI did not re-run the 4-player, host-leave, 2-player and server hub scenarios after these last bot and test changes. Game code is unchanged apart from the yard's bot waypoints, and those scenarios last passed against the previous build."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":681,"cache_read_input_tokens":877754,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":681},"output