{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkwj6rwTMkS4KnfrxJFP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The game is built and everything I can verify here passes against the final build. A full no-cheat playthrough from Arrival to the credits is still not done, and I'm stopping on that.\n\n**What passes**\n- **Node suites:** 391 checks pass.\n- **Browser and party checks:** the boot check (15), the same-computer party (5) and the invite-code party (4) pass.\n- **Hub harness:** the 2-player, 4-player lossy, host-leave and server scenarios all pass.\n- **With cheats:** the full run from Arrival to the credits (god mode and one-hit kills on) passes.\n- **Without cheats:** the bot plays the quay, road, cannery, yard and causeway and reaches the abbey. The test for that is marked as a known limit.\n\n**What this pass changed**\n- On Assisted difficulty the Bosun now calls half as many islanders (2 every 80 s instead of 4 every 40 s). With that change the no-cheat bot finally killed the Bosun, though it still died about 19 times doing it.\n- I also tried letting the no-cheat test run past the abbey. It stalled there on the Dame's crypt walk in that full run, even though the crypt completed in a separate run, so that walk isn't reliable. I put the test back to stopping at the abbey.\n\n**What stays open**\n- **No-cheat full run:** the bot still dies many times to the Bosun, and the plan's limit is 3 deaths per chapter. The crypt walk is unreliable, and the nave boss and the launch have never been played without cheats.\n- **Hand play and sound:** I can't play the game by hand or listen to the sound on this machine. Sound is only checked by rendering effects and songs offline for level and clipping.\n\nI did not touch the Source Information or the Testing, Engine and Prompt Feedback from earlier replies. The About text and `exit-interview.json` are unchanged."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":