{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkwoeCxkYWs2FwdG363a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The nave boss run without cheats gets to the final phase but runs out of pistol ammo and keeps dying there, so it doesn't finish. I'm not going to claim anything beyond what I've shown, so this is where it stands.\n\n**Still open from `PLAN.md`**\n- **No-cheat playthrough:** I don't have a full no-cheat run from Arrival to the credits.\n  - **Yard and abbey:** the bot dies about 19 times to the Bosun, and its walk through the Dame's crypt is unreliable in a full run.\n  - **Nave:** I tried it for the first time just now, on Assisted with all weapons and ammo given. The bot reaches the Mother phase, runs out of pistol ammo and keeps dying, with 11 deaths when I stopped it.\n  - **Launch:** never played without cheats.\n- **Hand play and sound:** I can't play the game by hand or listen to the sound on this machine. Sound is only checked by rendering every effect and song offline for level and clipping.\n\n**What does hold**\n- **Build and handover:** the single HTML build and `exit-interview.json` are in the work folder.\n- **Tests:** the Node suites passed (391) and the boot, party, invite-code and four hub scenario checks all passed on the last run. I changed no game code since, so I have not re-run them.\n- **With cheats:** the full run from Arrival to the credits (god mode and one-hit kills) passes.\n- **Without cheats:** the bot plays the quay, road, cannery, yard and causeway into the abbey.\n\nThe Source Information and the Testing, Engine and Prompt Feedback from my earlier replies are unchanged. Closing the no-cheat gap needs a much stronger fighting and ammo-managing bot than I built."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1165,"cache_read_input_tokens":887128,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tok