{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkx2GuA5771KCKf4fyhe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I changed nothing that moves the result, and a full no-cheat playthrough from Arrival to the credits is still not done. This pass I let the bot open treasure chests, hoping the extra doubloons would buy more ammo. The no-cheat run still reaches the abbey and no further.\n\n- **Where it fails:**\n  - **Bosun:** the bot dies about 19 times on Assisted, against the plan's limit of 3 per chapter.\n  - **Crypt:** its walk through the Dame's crypt is unreliable in a full run.\n  - **Nave boss:** it reaches the final phase, runs out of pistol ammo and keeps dying (11 deaths when I stopped it).\n  - **Launch:** never played without cheats.\n- **What I verified on this build:** the Node suites pass (391) after the rebuild. The browser, party, invite-code and four hub checks last passed on the previous build; the only change since is a small bot edit, so I didn't re-run them.\n- **Hand play and sound:** I can't play the game by hand or listen to the sound on this machine. Sound is only checked by rendering effects and songs offline for level and clipping.\n- **Handover:** the HTML build and `exit-interview.json` are in the work folder, and the Source Information and the Testing, Engine and Prompt Feedback from earlier replies are unchanged.\n\nI have no further approach to this open item that I expect to work without a much stronger bot, one that fights, manages ammo and plays the Bosun and the Dame's crypt reliably, so this is where I'm stopping."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":411,"cache_read_input_tokens":890035,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":411},"output_tokens":509,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"